
"smart_sources:2026-05-19 - ‘There was no real negative reaction’_ McCall to keep four-day work week.md": {"path":"2026-05-19 - ‘There was no real negative reaction’_ McCall to keep four-day work week.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1waycpu","at":1785795032780},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1783544520237,"size":4144,"at":1785795032967,"hash":"1waycpu"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,56]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor","target":"Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor","line":5},{"title":"Valley Lookout house - generic","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/82689d5d-b8b7-4c7f-9d4c-b24100ffd632.gif","line":20,"embedded":true},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":30,"embedded":true},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":40,"embedded":true},{"title":"Western States - Lookout creative - 4:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/115c0cfa-e547-4a5c-8f4e-7ea7e16f8bde.png","line":50,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"‘There was no real negative reaction’: McCall to keep four-day work week","source":"https://valleylookout.com/2026/05/19/there-was-no-real-negative-reaction-mccall-to-keep-four-day-work-week/?utm_source=newsletters.idahocapitalsun.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=little-pickens-win-party-primaries-six-gop-legislative-incumbents-lose-seats&_bhlid=e3fe8775816028581cc65288743fc1b219646ebe","author":["[[Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor]]"],"published":"2026-05-19","created":"2026-07-08","description":"Thursday is the new Friday — at least in the City of McCall. Last week, the McCall City Council signed off on a request by City Manager Forest Atkinson to permanently change the city’s work week to Monday through Thursday.  The move follows a six-month trial that began last December in a bid to reduce […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},